WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.356 --> 00:00:02.939
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.973 --> 00:00:09.984
- Freshman year of college

00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:12.295
I had a pretty rowdy group of friends.

00:00:12.295 --> 00:00:13.572
- On Sundays we used to go to

00:00:13.572 --> 00:00:15.361
this one friend's house
outside of the city.

00:00:15.361 --> 00:00:17.988
- We'd always have a bonfire,
and we'd drink a lot.

00:00:17.988 --> 00:00:19.371
- There was a Porta Potty on the land

00:00:19.371 --> 00:00:21.776
and we decided that it'd be
funny to put it on the fire.

00:00:21.776 --> 00:00:23.491
- All of us like we'd get the Porta Potty,

00:00:23.491 --> 00:00:25.036
we'd put it on top of the fire.

00:00:25.036 --> 00:00:27.446
- It went up in a
wonderful blaze of glory.

00:00:27.446 --> 00:00:29.289
- I remember opening up
the door and like seeing

00:00:29.289 --> 00:00:31.578
the flame come through the toilet.

00:00:31.578 --> 00:00:32.771
- So we went back to the house,

00:00:32.771 --> 00:00:35.613
and my friend who was the owner
of the land and Porta Potty,

00:00:35.613 --> 00:00:37.226
he asked who put it on the fire.

00:00:37.226 --> 00:00:38.537
And we all played stupid.

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:40.385
- He was like, "if you
guys don't replace it,

00:00:40.385 --> 00:00:43.143
I'm gonna whip your ass, whoop
your ass, whoop your ass"

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:44.614
and emphasis on my ass.

00:00:44.614 --> 00:00:47.167
- Because like, I was
like, mainly responsible.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:48.769
- So all week in between classes,

00:00:48.769 --> 00:00:50.199
I drove in that part of the city.

00:00:50.199 --> 00:00:51.875
- Looking for Porta Potties.

00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:54.412
I went to like construction sites,

00:00:54.412 --> 00:00:56.956
and I went to like, apartment complexes.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.159
- Finally found one.

00:00:58.159 --> 00:01:00.139
- I got two of my friends,
one of them had a truck.

00:01:00.139 --> 00:01:02.913
- To, you know, steal this Porta Potty.

00:01:02.913 --> 00:01:04.828
- I couldn't lift it,
'cause like, I'm little,

00:01:04.828 --> 00:01:06.657
so we had to call more friends.

00:01:06.657 --> 00:01:08.216
But like, I was in the middle,

00:01:08.216 --> 00:01:10.032
and so we were lifting it up and--

00:01:10.032 --> 00:01:12.513
- The pee and the poo fell all over me.

00:01:12.513 --> 00:01:15.197
- From like my waist
down I'm like covered.

00:01:15.197 --> 00:01:16.521
- And it was so gross.

00:01:16.521 --> 00:01:19.034
I smelled so bad, and I hated it so much.

00:01:19.034 --> 00:01:20.745
- In spite of that, we
got it on the truck,

00:01:20.745 --> 00:01:22.853
and it laid flat 'cause
those things are so tall.

00:01:22.853 --> 00:01:25.889
So we got in the truck, and
as we were driving back--

00:01:25.889 --> 00:01:27.146
- My friend almost wanted to give up,

00:01:27.146 --> 00:01:28.337
he was like about to, like, throw up.

00:01:28.337 --> 00:01:30.107
- But I was like, "Just keep driving,

00:01:30.107 --> 00:01:31.246
like, we have to get there."

00:01:31.246 --> 00:01:32.835
- so when we get back
to my friend's house,

00:01:32.835 --> 00:01:34.079
he has a party going on,

00:01:34.079 --> 00:01:36.619
which is what he needed the
Porta Potty for to begin with.

00:01:36.619 --> 00:01:38.479
So there's a whole bunch of people there.

00:01:38.479 --> 00:01:39.719
- And they see us with like

00:01:39.719 --> 00:01:41.929
this ridiculous Porta Potty
in the back of a truck,

00:01:41.929 --> 00:01:43.971
and they all start cheering for us.

00:01:43.971 --> 00:01:45.195
- Went home, took a shower,

00:01:45.195 --> 00:01:48.470
got back and finished the night, partied.

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:51.290
- I took about four showers
and I went to the party.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:53.645
- I went back home, and I took a shower,

00:01:53.645 --> 00:01:55.692
and then I went and partied.

00:01:55.692 --> 00:01:58.442
(dramatic music)

